## Choices you may want to check
- **Record wording:** I used a separate `- Overrode:` bullet and kept the old incident history in `- Reason:`. That bullet says "No reason for the override was recorded." I wrote that instead of making up a reason. Delete that sentence if you'd rather leave the reason out entirely.
- **`Forbidden:` bullet:** It only says not to switch back to `@container` without the maintainer's sign-off. I added no other constraint.
- **Line length:** The record keeps the 2-space continuation indent, and its longest line is 114 columns.
- **`.shell` class:** Any markup that uses `class="shell"` still works; the class just has no CSS rules now. I didn't search the markup for it, because deleting an empty rule doesn't change rendering.
